          "date": "2026-10-02 13:04:44.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-20866 o2iblnd: return tunables setup error",
        "message": "LU-20866 o2iblnd: return tunables setup error\n\nkiblnd_tun_defaults() returns 0 when kiblnd_tunables_setup() fails.\nThus, lnet_genl_parse_local_ni() never rejects a NI whose default o2ib\ntunables are invalid (e.g. a bad ib_mtu module parameter). The failure\nis only caught later in kiblnd_startup(), with \"Error -22 starting up\nLNI\" instead of \"default tunables are invalid\".\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Cyril Bordage <cbordage@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I49176cde52761f1998b319d12a59402a5a245c44\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
